  'contractor-named-r71-st-engenas-zcc-interchange-boyne-2026-10-30',
  'Contractor appointed for R450m R71 interchange at the ZCC headquarters in Boyne',
  'Traffic', '2026-10-30', 'Review', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/10/30/r450m-interchange-project-set-to-ease-congestion-at-moria/',
  'Raubex Construction has been introduced as the contractor for a R450 million interchange on the R71 at Boyne, with work expected to start in November 2026.',
  'The Limpopo Provincial Government and the national Department of Transport have formally handed over the appointed contractor for the St Engenas ZCC Interchange on the R71 at Boyne, in the Polokwane municipal area. Raubex Construction was introduced to church leadership at a handover event attended by the Premier and the Minister of Transport.

According to the provincial media release, the contract is worth R450 million, of which the province contributes R125 million through the Roads Agency Limpopo. The Transport Minister said the job is set to take about 18 months and construction is expected to begin in November 2026. Work includes flyover bridges. The Review reports that the plans also cover ramps, improved drainage and traffic management infrastructure.

The R71 links Polokwane and Tzaneen and is a busy route towards the Kruger National Park. Traffic is heaviest when large numbers of worshippers travel to the ZCC headquarters for major church gatherings. The interchange is meant to separate local traffic from through traffic and make access to the church and nearby communities safer.

The province says the start still depends on outstanding environmental approvals and on resolving matters about land parcels controlled by different stakeholders. It also says a community engagement structure will be set up, and that local labour and suppliers will be used.

Motorists on the R71 near Boyne should watch for official notices about construction and any traffic accommodation once work begins.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/10/30/r450m-interchange-project-set-to-ease-congestion-at-moria/", "https://www.limpopo.gov.za/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Government-hands-over-contractor-for-the-R450-Million-St-Engenas-ZCC-Interchange.pdf"]',
  'agent'
